## 2. `include/strata/artifact/gguf_reader.hpp` — GGUF File Reader

**Responsibilities:** Parses GGUF v3 files via mmap, reads metadata KV pairs, tensor directory, validates architecture (`qwen4exp`), provides `GgufFile` and `GgufModel` (multi-shard) classes, and block geometry lookup.

**Proposed change:** Add a `tensor_offset_valid()` method to `GgufFile` that checks whether a tensor's offset + payload fits within the file's data section, and expose it so callers can validate before reading.

```diff
--- a/include/strata/artifact/gguf_reader.hpp
+++ b/include/strata/artifact/gguf_reader.hpp
@@ -280,6 +280,18 @@
     }
     const uint8_t* tensor_data(const TensorInfo& t) const { return base_ + data_start_ + t.offset; }

+    /// Whether tensor `t`'s payload lies entirely within this file's data section.
+    /// Returns false when the type is unknown, the row count is not whole blocks, or the span exceeds EOF.
+    bool tensor_offset_valid(const TensorInfo& t) const {
+        const uint64_t bytes = tensor_payload_bytes(t);
+        if (bytes == 0) return false;
+        const uint64_t payload = size_ - data_start_;
+        return t.offset <= payload && bytes <= payload - t.offset;
+    }
+
+    /// The data-section size in bytes (file_size - data_start).
+    uint64_t data_section_bytes() const { return size_ - data_start_; }
